00:44:05.880 --> 00:44:06.460
e sensibilidade

00:44:06.460 --> 00:44:07.200
permanece curta.

00:44:07.720 --> 00:44:08.120
Três ou quatro

00:44:08.120 --> 00:44:08.600
abrangem a maioria

00:44:08.600 --> 00:44:09.160
